  "description": "<p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"362\">De MSI Thin 15 is een krachtige gaming laptop die geschikt is voor gaming, studie en dagelijks gebruik. Dankzij de Intel Core i5-processor en het snelle werkgeheugen kun je soepel multitasken en moderne games spelen. Het slanke ontwerp maakt deze laptop daarnaast makkelijk mee te nemen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"389\"><strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"373\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"376\">Nieuw In Doos</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"599\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"406\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"409\">⭐ Intel Core i5 processor van de 12e generatie<br data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"458\">⭐ 16GB RAM voor soepel multitasken<br data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"495\">⭐ Snelle 512GB SSD-opslag<br data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"523\">⭐ Slank en modern gaming design<br data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"557\" data-is-only-node=\"\">⭐ Geschikt voor gaming en productiviteit</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"948\">📋 <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"621\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"624\"><strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"638\">Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (12e generatie)<br data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"671\"><strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"679\">RAM:</strong> 16GB DDR4<br data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"703\">Opslag:</strong> 512GB SSD<br data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"716\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"736\">Grafische kaart:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050<br data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"779\"><strong data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"790\">Scherm:</strong> 15.6 inch Full HD, 144Hz<br data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"818\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"840\">Besturingssysteem:</strong> Windows 11<br data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"854\"><strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"873\">Connectiviteit:</strong> WiFi, Bluetooth, USB, HDMI<br data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\"><strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"913\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"922\"><strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"932\">Staat:</strong> Nieuw In Doos</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1201\">📋 <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"983\">Gameprestaties (schatting)</strong><br data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"986\"><strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"999\">Fortnite:</strong> ± 90–120 FPS (1080p, Medium/High settings)<br data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\"><strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1057\">Warzone:</strong> ± 60–75 FPS (1080p, Medium settings)<br data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1107\">GTA V:</strong> ± 90 FPS (1080p, High settings)<br data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1142\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1156\">Minecraft:</strong> ± 200+ FPS (1080p, standaard instellingen)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1277\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1221\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1224\">MSI Thin 15 B13UC-2848NL<br data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\">Oplader<br data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1261\">Originele doos</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1338\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1301\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1304\">Incl. Garantie: 6 maanden garantie</p>",
